Output ../assets/demo/tour.gif
Output ../assets/demo/tour.mp4
Source tapes/settings.tape

Hide
Type "clear && beepertui" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 1.2s
Down@350ms 3
Sleep 400ms
Up@350ms 3
Sleep 400ms
# Design Team: sender colours, day and "new" rules, link card, seen-by under your latest message
Enter
Sleep 3s
# scroll up: the GIF plays, selecting a message shows who reacted
Up@450ms 2
Sleep 2.5s
Up@450ms 2
Sleep 1.5s
Down@350ms 4
Sleep 1s
Type "]"
Sleep 1s
Type "["
Sleep 600ms
Type "?"
Sleep 3.5s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
